SUMMARY:Part Closure: District Line: Saturday 5 and Sunday 6 September\, no
  service between Edgware Road and Wimbledon. Rail Replacement bus services
  will operate. If travelling to/from Fulham vs Crystal Palace on 
 Saturday\, it may be easier to walk to/from Hammersmith.
END:VEVENT
