SUMMARY:Interchange Message: Chelsea Women vs Aston Villa Women at Stamford
  Bridge on Saturday 5 September\, 1230 start: Fulham Broadway station will
  be busier than normal before and after the match. A queuing system and 
 special matchday entrance in Wansdown Place will be in operation once the 
 match has finished.
